Step 1 — Find where the template folder actually exists:

powershell
Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Filter "*.xlsx" | Select-Object FullName
Step 2 — Show what is in your application.properties:

powershell
Get-Content (Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Filter "application.properties" | Select-Object -First 1).FullName
Paste the output of both and I will give you the exact fix to point it to the correct folder.
